case of overdue principal of any Loan, 2.0% per annum <U>plus</U> the rate otherwise applicable to such Loan as provided in the preceding paragraphs of this Section&nbsp;3.08 or (ii)&nbsp;in the case of any other amount, 2.0% per annum <U>plus</U>
the rate applicable to ABR Loans as provided in Section&nbsp;3.08(a). </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(e) Accrued interest on each Loan shall be payable in arrears on
