Rate is not available or published on a current basis) or (B)&nbsp;at any time, that adequate and reasonable means do not exist for ascertaining the Daily Simple SOFR; or </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(ii) the Administrative Agent is advised by the Required Lenders (A)&nbsp;prior to the commencement of any Interest Period for
a Term SOFR Borrowing, that the Term SOFR for such Interest Period will not adequately and fairly reflect the cost to such Lenders of making or maintaining the Loans included in such Borrowing for such Interest Period or (B)&nbsp;at any time, that
the Daily Simple SOFR will not adequately and fairly reflect the cost of such Lenders of making or maintaining their Loans included in any Daily Simple SOFR Borrowing; </P>
